        "object" : {
          "content" : "I&#39;m renting the apartment so I can&#39;t make any changes to the wiring. <br /><br />To flush out my idea some more, I want it so that the light switch turns both lamps on and off. And then each lamp would have it&#39;s own switch to turn it on and off. Right now if I turn the light switch off, power is killed and I can&#39;t turn the lamp back on unless I switch the light switch. ",
          "objectType" : "comment",
          "originalContent" : "I'm renting the apartment so I can't make any changes to the wiring. \n\nTo flush out my idea some more, I want it so that the light switch turns both lamps on and off. And then each lamp would have it's own switch to turn it on and off. Right now if I turn the light switch off, power is killed and I can't turn the lamp back on unless I switch the light switch. "
        },
